                <pb facs="0369" n="237" sameAs="frus:frus1926v01/pg237"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Treaty Series No. 762</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Procès-Verbal of the Deposit of Ratifications of the
                        International Sanitary Contention by Czechoslovakia</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg></opener>
                <p>In accordance with the provisions of Article 170 of the International Sanitary
                    Convention signed at Paris June 21, 1926, the Minister of the Czechoslovak
                    Republic this day called at the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the French
                    Republic and deposited the instrument of ratifications of that International Act
                    by His Excellency the President of the Czechoslovak Republic.</p>
                <p>The instrument being, upon examination, found to be in good and due form, has
                    been entrusted to the Government of the French Republic to be kept in its
                    archives.</p>
                <p>A certified copy of this procès-verbal shall be sent to the contracting
                    Powers.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Done at <placeName>Paris</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1928-03-28">March 28,
                        1928</date>.</dateline><lb/>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal</hi>]
                            <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Briand</hi></signed><lb/>[<hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">seal</hi>] <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Stefan Osusky</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
